{"type":"text","timestamp":1792607824845,"sessionID":"ses_ea047f5cfffeVdnhYi9rEaJgee","part":{"id":"prt_15fc03fa4001YkjXK8E7LJGgfD","sessionID":"ses_ea047f5cfffeVdnhYi9rEaJgee","messageID":"msg_15fbf2408001pZ8nW9rO4hMeHn","type":"text","text":"## Independent semantic review — DOCX 0104 / I18-E11 / checkbox 112\n\n### Scope statement (explicit)\n- **Scope is text-only.** I reviewed the complete extracted body (all paragraphs and all 31 tables) supplied in `review_packet_0104_R14.md` against the attached source packet, unique Blueprint JSONL, crosswalk row, official page-7 text extract, and the synthetic replacement register CSV.\n- **Target SHA-256 verified at byte level:** `candidate\\0104__證照獲取率_分析報告_R14.docx` = `37876e73572794cff8ab23d2d45f3924dbae77788896fab2170c45935bc395bb` — exact match to the required target. Inputs also match the manifest hashes (packet `d5a48eb9…`, source packet `a3c88e83…`, Blueprint `65bfb2bb…`, crosswalk `92229494…`, page-7 extract `78a60101…`, register `1df05480…`).\n- **I do NOT claim:** visual inspection or rendering of the DOCX, font/layout QA (10.5pt/9.5pt test), execution of the SOP or any formula by software, provider/model identity, official-source PDF hash verification (`805386b7…` is attested only; only the page-7 text extract was hashed), repo blob/PR attestations (PR #92 HEAD, R09 contract, quality-manual blob — **UNKNOWN**), or any formal association/evaluator acceptance. The extract-to-DOCX correspondence is attested by the manifest (188 paragraphs, 31 tables; 31 tables present in extract), **not** independently re-extracted by me.\n\n### Overall verdict: **PARTIAL**\nCore semantics are sound: correct requirement binding and genre, correct zero-denominator rule with F-RC-01/F-RC-04 = N/A + 0/0 recomputation, correct and mostly exact arithmetic, a complete usable SAMPLE example, honest REAL/UNKNOWN boundaries, no fabricated facts found, and explicit separation from 0103/E10 and 0105/E13. PARTIAL is forced by two internal factual inconsistencies (one directly in the zero-denominator/report↔register consistency check), register completeness gaps, and wrong first-page navigation locators.\n\n### Criterion matrix (per packet checklist 1–10)\n\n| # | Criterion | Verdict | Locator + evidence |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Exact official requirement & report genre | **PASS** | Header row `文件編號 0104　評核項目 I18-E11　官方佐證項次 112`; §26 T-31; Blueprint row `deliverable_id=0104 / I18-E11 / 分析／評估報告`; crosswalk row `0104,證照獲取率_分析報告`. Genre is analysis/evaluation: data, denominators, formulas, step calcs, limits, decisions (§8 T-07, §11, §13–§16, §25). |\n| 1b | Official source binding (text) | **PASS (text)** | §2.1 quotes printed p.7「證照獲取率。」under 4分指標「目標客戶及學員認為訓練有顯著具體績效。」; also correctly cites 3分「高證照通過率之證明資料。」and truncation-flagged 1分 fragment「學員考照通過率有增加，但未有…」— all match attached page-7 text. Page-7 PDF itself not present here (**UNKNOWN** hash). |\n| 2 | Unique content (not E10/E13 substitute) | **PASS** | §2.2, §20 T-20 (rows for 0103/I18-E10, 0105/I18-E13, 0102/I18-E09 with differentiating fields), §25.1(5). No thank-you-letter custody workflow, no satisfaction/survey outcome imported. |\n| 3 | Title-blind purpose check | **PASS** | With title/filename masked, §3 (P1–P5 populations), §8 T-07 (six rate formulas), §9 four-stage chain, §11.1–11.3 step tables, §17 R-6 identify uniquely「證照獲取率_分析報告」and point to the proving text (§2.1; §8; §11; T-10 row P5). Not transferable to another requirement without rewriting. |\n| 4 | Definitions / populations / denominators | **PASS** | §3 + T-03 (extract TABLE 3): P1–P5 with identity equations; §8 T-07 (extract TABLE 7): application P2/P1, attendance P3/P2, pass P4/P3, verified acquisition P5/P1, issuance-completion P5/P4, pass yield P4/P1 correctly named 通過產出率 (never relabeled 取證率); non-applicants/no-shows/failed/uncontactable/pending/failed-verification shown as rows (T-10 P8–P11). |\n| 5 | Arithmetic / population reconciliation | **PARTIAL** | Verified correct: T-10 totals 76/65/60/48/43/3/2/11/5/12/4; T-14 identities for A/B/C/合計; §11.1 all six A rates (80.00/90.63/75.86/86.36/47.50/55.00) and §11.2 all six B rates (91.67/93.94/83.87/92.31/66.67/72.22) recomputed exactly; chain identity A-7/B-7 ✓; §13 totals 65/76=85.53%, 60/65=92.31%, 48/60=80.00%, 43/76=56.58% ✓; T-12 point/relative deltas ✓; T-13 gaps (−12.50 pp = 5人; −3.64 pp = 1件; −5.00 pp = 2人) ✓; cutoff 2026-06-27 +90d = 2026-09-25 ✓; D-1…D-5 dates match stated +14/+14/+7/+7/+49d rules ✓. **Defects: B1, B2, N1 below.** |\n| 6 | Zero-denominator logic; report↔register consistency (F-RC-01/F-RC-04) | **PARTIAL** | **Required items PASS:** §8 hard rule「分母為 0 → N/A，不得顯示 0%」; §11.3 T (extract TABLE 12) C-1…C-5 all `0÷0 → N/A`; register CSV `F-RC-01 = N/A, 申請率, §11.3/C-1, 0/0 重算` ✓ and `F-RC-04 = N/A, 已驗證取證率, §11.3/C-5, 0/0 重算` ✓; no `0/9` anywhere. **Defects: B1, B2, B3, N2 below** (T-14 shows C = 0.00%; gate status underlists; C-4 rate has no register key). |\n| 7 | Complete usable SAMPLE example + REAL/UNKNOWN boundary | **PASS** | §10 T-10/T-11 (two comparable cohorts A/B, common cutoff, plus C zero-denominator edge), §5 T-05 field dictionary, SRC-A1…SRC-X1 lineage, §11 full step-by-step calcs incl. §11.4 order-dependence caveat, §12 comparison + conservative trend text + no-significance disclaimer, §14 E0–E4, §15 T-15, §16 T-16 (all results「未執行（示範）」except D-0 — see B4), §25.3 limits. All thresholds labeled `SAMPLE—待協會核定` (§12, §23, §25.2); §1/§10/§25.1 state it is not association performance and cannot support a TTQS rating. |\n| 8 | Truthful REAL/UNKNOWN; no fabricated facts | **PASS** | §7 T (extract TABLE 6) U01–U21 = 21 items all UNKNOWN, §25.1「尚不可計算，而不是取證率為 0」, REAL = E0 (§14, §26). Provider labeled示例 (§10; F-PV-01/02). No invented approvals, people, certificates, signatures, or third-party originals; §25.2 release boxes all unchecked; §23 forbids reproducing third-party originals; §12 states no real chart images used. 93 register keys in §19 (14+18+33+32) match the CSV exactly. |\n| 9 | Usability for volunteer administrator/evaluator | **PARTIAL** | Strong: §21 12-step SOP (input/judgment/control point/output/role), §17 T-17 checklist, §22 C01–C15 (15 items), §24 index. **Defect B5** (first-page 30-second guide has three wrong pointers) and **N3** (FN-1 evidence locator mismatch). |\n| 10 | Limitations, evidence grading, follow-up, register completeness | **PARTIAL** | Limitations §25.3/§12 ✓; grading §14 + §24 ✓; follow-up §16/§22 ✓. **Register incomplete: B3, B4, N4 below.** |\n\n### Blocking defects (must be fixed; prevent PASS)\n\n| ID | Exact locator | Defect / evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| **B1** | §13 對帳表 **T-14** (extract TABLE 16), row「乘法鏈 = 取證率」, column **C** | Displays **`0.00% ✓`** for the zero-denominator cohort. Violates §8 rule (「分母為 0 → 顯示 N/A，不得顯示 0%」) and contradicts register `F-RC-04 = N/A / 0/0 重算` and §11.3 C-5 = N/A. Direct report↔register inconsistency in the exact area targeted by check (6). |\n| **B2** | §18 例外處理矩陣 **T-19** (extract TABLE 22), rows「未申請」and「失聯」, column **C** | Shows **未申請 = 9** and **失聯 = 3** for cohort C, contradicting T-10 rows P8/C = 0 and P11/C = 0 (T-10 note「C：0」), §11.3「P1 至 P11 均為 0」, §10（C 不納入比較）, and register `F-PC-08 = 0`, `F-PC-11 = 0`. Population reconciliation failure for the zero-denominator cohort (all other T-19 C cells = 0 are correct). |\n| **B3** | §11.3 step **C-4**（簽發查證完成率, `0÷0 → N/A`, extract TABLE 12 row C-4) vs register §19.4 | **No fact key exists for C-4.** Register has `F-RC-01 (C-1)`, `F-RC-02 (C-2)`, `F-RC-03 (C-3)`, `F-RC-04 (C-5)` only — a computed rate in the report is unregistered, violating the packet rule「每一項…比例…皆有逐事實替換簿記錄鍵」. |\n| **B4** | §16 **T-16** row **D-0**(結果「生效中」) vs §16 preamble「「結果」欄一律為「未執行（示範）」」and register **`F-RS-01` =「全部為『未執行（示範）』」**(loc `§16 結果欄`) | Preamble/register claim 「all results = 未執行（示範）」 is false for D-0, and decision **D-0 itself has no `F-DS` key** (register stops at `F-DS-05`). Report↔register inconsistency + missing decision key. |\n| **B5** | §1 摘要「三十秒讀法」 (first-page 30-second guide) | Three wrong pointers: ①「第 9 節（真實資料還缺什麼）」→ should be **§7** (cf. §24 index「真實資料還缺什麼｜§7」and §25.2「第 7 節 21 項 UNKNOWN」; §9 is the four-stage chain); ②「表 T-15（哪一段缺口最大）」→ should be **T-13** (§24「缺口優先序｜§12 T-13」; T-15 is the findings table); ③「表 T-18（誰在什麼時候做什麼）」→ should be **T-16** (T-18 = 保留閘門). Defeats the Blueprint first-page 30-second usability acceptance test. |\n\n### Nonblocking concerns\n\n| ID | Locator | Issue |\n|---|---|---|\n| N1 | §12 **T-13** (extract TABLE 15) rows 1–2 | Step-1 cumulative shown **54.43%** and contribution **+6.93 pp**; exact unrounded = 627/1152 = **54.4358% → 54.44%, +6.94 pp**. Step-2 contribution shown **+1.99** vs exact **+1.98** (56.41745 − 54.43576). Violates own rule (T-04「差異以未四捨五入值計算」). Total +19.17 and shares (36.2/10.4/31.1/22.4 = 100.1, flagged) still reconcile; sums unaffected. |\n| N2 | §18 **T-18** row **G9**, column「本案示例狀態」 | Lists only「C 期到考率、通過率觸發」; §11.3 marks **five** rates N/A (申請率 P1=0、簽發查證完成率 P4=0、已驗證取證率 P1=0 also have zero denominators). Register locators reflect the same asymmetry (`F-RC-02/03` cite T-18 G9; `F-RC-01/04` do not). |\n| N3 | §15 **T-15** row **FN-1**, 證據 column | 「T-10、**T-11** A-4/A-5」— A-4/A-5 are steps of the §11.1 calculation table; **T-11 =「表 T-11 世代與日期」(§10)**, which contains no A-4/A-5. Wrong evidence locator (§11.1’s three calculation tables carry no visible T-number in the extract). |\n| N4 | §12 T-13 / §12 T-12 / §12 方法提醒 | Derived synthetic figures unkeyed: T-13 cumulative rates & contributions (54.43/56.42/62.37; +6.93…), T-12 相對變化 (14.58%…), and the CI claim「95% 區間半寬約 ±13～16 個百分點」(p/n not stated, no key). Recomputable from keyed inputs, but the packet requires every rate be registered. |\n| N5 | Blueprint `required_calculations_or_analysis` vs §8 **T-07** and §17 **T-17 R-8** | R-8 claims「成果率／變化率／通過率口徑…分列定義」at 第 8 節 + T-12, but **§8 T-07 defines neither 成果率 nor a 變化率 formula** (six rows: 申請/到考/通過/已驗證取證/簽發查證完成/通過產出). 相對變化 values in T-12 do equal (B−A)/A and are recomputable; P5/P1 is semantically the Blueprint 成果率. → Blueprint calculation coverage **PARTIAL**. |\n| N6 | §24 index row「真實資料還缺什麼｜§7 **T-08**」 | Table captions **T-01–T-09 are absent from the supplied extract**; sequential numbering implied by §17 R-2 (「表 T-03（第 3 節表）」) would place the §7 UNKNOWN table at T-06. Locator **UNKNOWN** (cannot verify without rendering). Similarly「T-12 註」(§24, T-15 FN-3) has no visible caption → **UNKNOWN**. |\n| N7 | §3 P1–P5 vs T-10 rows **P6–P11** vs T-13 column「優先」**P1/P2/P3** | The token \"P\" denotes populations, exception counts, and priority ranks in the same document — ambiguity risk for evaluators (register locators like `T-10/P5/A` are unambiguous only inside T-10). |\n| N8 | §13 narrative | Gives only 4 of the 6 aggregate rates (omits 43/48 = 89.58% and 48/76 = 63.16%); labeled「僅算術」, so an omission rather than an error. |\n\n### UNKNOWN / coverage limitations\n- **Visual QA UNKNOWN:** no page images supplied; fonts (≥10.5pt/9.5pt), layout, table rendering, and caption placement were **not** inspected.\n- **Execution UNKNOWN:** I recomputed all figures manually from displayed text only; no script/tool execution of the report, and no claim about the DOCX’s internal fields.\n- **Official source PDF hash UNKNOWN:** `805386b7…` is attested in the packet; only `official_pdf_page7_text_extract.txt` (`78a60101…`) was hashed by me.\n- **Repo/attestation UNKNOWN:** PR #92 HEAD `0da7b7fe…`, R09 contract blob `4c7eff55…`, quality-manual blob `8c2bbe7c…`, `BLUEPRINT_CURRENT.jsonl` row hashes, `evidence/source_stage_receipt_0104_R01.json` — not verifiable in this workspace.\n- **Table numbering T-01–T-09 UNKNOWN** (see N6), affecting verification of two §24/§17 cross-references.\n- **No provider model identity, no performance inference, and no formal acceptance is claimed.** Association performance remains **UNKNOWN (E0)** — never zero, per §7/§25.1; I concur with that treatment.\n- **Overall: PAR